days←toDate ymd;v;y;m;d;baseNs;targetNs
⍝ Convert (year month day) -> duckdb_date days since 1970-01-01.
⍝ Use Dyalog date conversion (platform-safe, no struct ABI calls).

v←,ymd
:If 3≠≢v
    days←0
    →0
:EndIf

y m d←v
:If (m<1)∨m>12∨d<1∨d>31
    days←0
    →0
:EndIf

baseNs←10 ⎕DT⊂1970 1 1 0 0 0 0
targetNs←10 ⎕DT⊂y m d 0 0 0 0
days←⌊(targetNs-baseNs)÷8.64E13

⍝ KSL 1.0.0
